BT /F1 9 Tf 40 800 Td 12 TL (NOTICE INVITING e-TENDER - SAMPLE FOR TESTING \(made-up, not a real tender\)) ' (NIT No. 18/EE/ED-IV/2026-27) ' (Name of Work: Electrical installation including LT panel, cabling and lighting for the new Academic) ' (Block, Government Polytechnic College, Kota.) ' (Estimated Cost put to tender: Rs. 31,40,000) ' (Period of Completion: 3 \(Three\) Months) ' (Last date of submission of bids: 12-11-2026 up to 15:00 hrs) ' ET BT /F1 8 Tf 280 25 Td (Page 1 of 64) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
