4 0 obj
<< /Length 874 >>
stream
BT /F1 9 Tf 40 800 Td 12 TL (Eligibility Criteria) ' (1. The bidder should have satisfactorily completed during the last seven years: three similar works each) ' (of value not less than Rs. 20.00 Lakh, or two similar works each of value not less than Rs. 30.00 Lakh,) ' (or one similar work of value not less than Rs. 40.00 Lakh.) ' (2. Average annual financial turnover during the last 3 years ending 31st March 2026 should be at least) ' (Rs. 1.20 Crore.) ' (3. The bidder must hold a valid ISO 14001 certificate \(Environmental Management System\) on the date of) ' (submission of bid.) ' (4. The bidder must hold a valid Electrical Contractor Licence issued by the competent authority of the) ' (State Government.) ' (5. Similar work shall mean electrical installation works including LT panels and cabling in a building.) ' ET BT /F1 8 Tf 280 25 Td (Page 2 of 64) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
5 0 obj
<< /Type /Page /Parent 130 0 R /MediaBox [0 0 595 842] /Resources << /Font << /F1 1 0 R >> >> /Contents 4 0 R >>
endobj
6 0 obj
<< /Length 383 >>
stream
BT /F1 9 Tf 40 800 Td 12 TL (Earnest Money Deposit) ' (Earnest Money: Rs. 62,800 to be deposited online through the e-procurement portal.) ' (No exemption from Earnest Money shall be granted to any category of bidder, including MSEs.) ' (Relaxation in turnover and experience criteria shall not be available to any category of bidder.) ' ET BT /F1 8 Tf 280 25 Td (Page 3 of 64) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
